## Bundled artwork

Everything under `server/web/assets/` — furniture, floor tiles, wall tiles and
character sprite sheets — is the open-source art set from Pixel Agents:

    Pixel Agents — https://github.com/pixel-agents-hq/pixel-agents
    Copyright (c) 2026 Pablo De Lucca
    MIT License — full text in server/web/assets/LICENSE.pixel-agents

The character sprites in that set are based on the free Metro City top-down
character pack by JIK-A-4:

    https://jik-a-4.itch.io/metrocity-free-topdown-character-pack

The art is redistributed here unmodified. The renderer that draws it
(`server/web/office.js`) is ours; the colorize maths it uses to tint the
grayscale floor and wall tiles follows the algorithm in the Pixel Agents editor.


## Designed against, no code taken from

  - NousResearch/hermes-agent (MIT) — the agent, and the public subagent
    lifecycle API that makes per-desk models possible without a fork.
  - teknium1/hermes-pixel-office — the hook -> event log -> canvas shape.
  - aiunlocked1412/hermes-agent-pixel — the server-discovery and
    fire-and-forget relay pattern used by the plugin sink, and the route that
    led us to the Pixel Agents art set.
